    "title": "General Hodge track: identify a genuinely uniform proof mechanism",
    "description": "Keep this strictly separate from W114.\n\nA solution to the Millennium problem must prove surjectivity of the rational cycle-class map for every smooth projective complex variety and every codimension.\n\nResearch task:\ncatalogue candidate uniform mechanisms (motives/standard conjectures, coniveau/generalized Hodge routes, deformation/variational Hodge, arithmetic/Tate comparison, derived/categorical constructions), and for each identify the exact theorem that would imply Hodge plus the unsolved gap.\n\nW114 and other Fermat computations may calibrate mechanisms but cannot establish uniformity.",
